<h2>Common insurance claims in Seguin</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Tornado and wind damage.</strong> Torn-off roofing, broken windows, collapsed carports and barns, and fallen trees. See <a href="/services/wind-damage-claims/">wind damage claims</a> and <a href="/services/storm-damage-claims/">storm damage claims</a>.</li>
